OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over van murder bid on
OL,4,Atwo police officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 32-year-old man has been arrested and
OL,7,Fcharged in connection with the
OL,8,Fattempted murder of two police officers
OL,9,Fin South Lanarkshire.
OL,11,FThe officers had been carrying out
OL,12,Finquiries at a property on Glen Avenue,
OL,13,FLarkhall, when a white Renault Traffic
OL,14,Fvan was deliberately driven at them.
OL,16,FThe incident happened at about 14:10 on
OL,17,F25 July.
OL,19,FPolice Scotland said the suspect was
OL,20,Farrested after a vehicle was stopped at
OL,21,Fjunction 8 on the M74 at about 20:40 on
OL,22,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
